P It may be expected I should say a few words of the duke’s person. He
@column
  generally wears a frock coat, and rides frequently on horseback. His nose
  is slightly curved; but there is nothing peculiar in his hat or boots, the
  latter of which are, of course, Wellington’s. His habits are still those of a
