@rule
h EXTRAORDINARY OPERATION.
h __Royal__ __Dispensary__ __for__ __Diseases__ __of__ __the__ __Ear__.
P Our esteemed friend and staunch supporter Colonel Sibthorp has lately, in
  the most heroic manner, submitted to an unprecedented and wonderfully suc-
  cessful operation. Our gallant friend was suffering from a severe elongation of
  the auricular organs; amputation was proposed, and submitted to with most
  heroic patience. We are happy to state the only inconvenience resulting from
  the operation is the establishment of a new hat block, and a slight difficulty of
  recognition on the part of some of his oldest friends.
@rule
h EXTRAORDINARY ASSIZE INTELLIGENCE.
P One of the morning papers gave its readers last week a piece of extraordinary
  assize intelligence, headed—“__Cutting__ __a__ __wife’s__ __throat—before__ __Mr.__ __Serjeant__
  __Taddy__” We advise the learned Serjeant to look to this: ’tis a too serious
  joke to be set down as an accessary to the cutting of a wife’s throat.
@rule
h A SPOKE IN S—Y’S WHEEL!
V “For Ireland’s weal!” hear turncoat S—y rave,
V Who’d trust the __wheel__ that own’d so sad a __knave__?
@rule
h ALARMING DESTITUTION.
P In the parish of Llanelly, Breconshire, the males exceed the females by more
  than one thousand. At Worcester, says the __Examiner__, the same majority is
  in favour of the ladies. We should propose a conference and a general swap of
  the sexes next market-day, as we understand there is not a window in Worcester
  without a notice of “Lodgings to let for single men,” whilst at Llanelly the
  gentlemen declare sweethearts can’t be had for “love nor money.”
@rule
h A NATURAL INFERENCE.
V “There’ll soon be rare work (cry the journals in fear),
V When Peel is call’d in in __his__ regular way;”
V True—for when we’ve to pay all the Tories, ’tis clear,
V It is much the same thing as the __devil__ __to__ __pay__.
@rule
h THE TORY TABLE D’HOTE—BILLY HOLMES (__loquitur__)
P “Walk up, walk up, ladies and gentlemen, feeding is going to commence
  Wellington and Peel are now giving their opening dinners to their friends and
  admirers. All who want __places__ must come early. Walk up! walk up!—This
  is the real constitutional tavern. Here we are! gratis feeding for the greedy!
  Make way there for those hungry-looking gentlemen—walk up, sir—leave your
  vote at the bar, and take a ticket for your hat.”
@rule
h BLACK AND WHITE.
V The Tories vow the Whigs are black as night,
V And boast that they are only blessed with light.
V Peel’s politics to both sides so incline,
V His may be called the __equinoctial__ __line__.
@rule
h THE LEGAL ECCALOBEION.
P Baron Campbell, who has sat altogether about 20 hours in the Irish Court
  of Chancery, will receive 4,000__l__. a-year, on the death of either Lord Manners or
  Lord Plunkett, (both octogenarians;) which, says the __Dublin__ __Monitor__,
  “taking the average of human life, he will enjoy thirty years;” and adds,
  “20 hours contain 1,200 minutes; and 4,000__l__. a-year for thirty years gives
  120,000__l__. So that he will receive for the term of his natural life just one
  hundred pounds for every minute that he sat as Lord Chancellor.” Pleasant
  incubation this! Sitting 20 hours, and hatching a fortune. If there be any truth
  in metempsychosis, Jocky Campbell must be the __goose__ __that__ __laid__ __golden__ __eggs__.
@rule
h IRISH PARTICULAR.
V SHEIL’S oratory’s like bottled Dublin stout;
V For, draw the cork, and only froth comes out.
@rule
h CALUMNY REFUTED.
P We can state on the most positive authority that the recent fire at the Army
  and Navy Club did not originate from a spark of Colonel Sibthorp’s wit falling
  amongst some loose jokes which Captain Marryatt had been scribbling on the
  backs of some unedited purser’s bills.
@rule
h HITTING THE RIGHT NAIL ON THE HEAD.
V The Whigs resemble nails—How so, my master?
V Because, like nails, when __beat__ they __hold__ __the__ __faster__.
@rule
h A MATTER OF TASTE.
P “Do you admire Campbell’s ‘Pleasures of Hope’?” said Croker to Hook.
  “Which do you mean, the Scotch poet’s or the Irish Chancellor’s? the real or
  the ideal—Tommy’s four thousand lines or Jocky’s four thousand pounds a-year?”
  inquired Theodore. Croker has been in a brown study ever since.
@page 53 leaf 56
@column
h CHARLES KEAN’S “CHEEK.”
P MR. PUNCH,—Myself and a few other old Etonians have read with inex-
  pressible scorn, disgust, and indignation, the heartless and malignant
  attempts, in your scoundrel journal, to blast the full-blown fame of that
  most transcendant actor, and most unexceptionable son, Mr. Charles Kean.
  Now, PUNCH, fair play is beyond any of the crown jewels. I will advance
  only one proof, amongst a thousand others that cart-horses sha’n’t draw
  from me, to show that Charles Kean makes more—mind, I say, makes
  __more__—of Shakspere, than every other actor living or dead. Last night I
  went to the Haymarket—Lady Georgiana L—— and other fine girls were
  of the party. The play was “Romeo and Juliet,” and there are in that
  tragedy two slap-up lines; they are, to the best of my recollection, as follow:—
V “__Oh!__ that I were a glove upon that hand,
V That I might touch that __cheek__.”
P Now, ninety-nine actors out of a hundred make nothing of this—not so
  Charles Kean. Here’s my proof. Feeling devilish hungry, I thought I’d
  step out for a snack, and left the box, just as Charles Kean, my old school-
  fellow, was beginning— “Oh!—
# ? “Oh!—”
P Well, I crossed the way, stepped into Dubourg’s, swallowed two dozen
  oysters, took a bottom of brandy, and booked a small bet with Jack Spavin
  for the St. Leger, returned to the theatre, and was comfortably seated in
  my box, as Charles Kean, my old school-fellow, had arrived at
  cheek!”
P Now, PUNCH, if this isn’t making much of Shakspere, what is?
P Yours (you scoundrel), ETONIAN.
@rule
h AN AN-TEA ANACREONTIC—No. 4.
# ? Tue following ode is somewhat freely translated from the original of a
# ? Chinese emigrant named Ca-Ta-NA-cH, or the ‘illustrious minstrel.”’
# ? We have given a short specimen of the original, merely substituting the
# ? Roman for the Chinese characters.
h ORIGINAL.
V As-ye-Te-i-anp-o-et-sli-re
V Y-oun-g-li-ae-us-di-din-spi-re
V Wen-ye-ba-r-da-wo-Ke-i-sla-is
V Lo-ve-et-wi-nea-li-ket-op-ra-is
V So-i-lus-tri-ou-spi-din-th-o-u
V In-s-pi-re-thi-Te-ur-nv-ot-a-rin-ow &amp;c. &amp;c.
# ? -&e. &e.
h TRANSLATION.
V As the Teian poet’s lyre
V Young Lyæus did inspire;
V When the bard awoke his lays,
V Love and wine alike to praise.
V So, illustrious Pidding, thou
V Inspire thy __tea__-urn votary now,
V Whilst the tea-pot circles round—
V Whilst the toast is being brown’d—
V Let me, ere I quaff my tea,
V Sing a paean unto thee,
V IO PIDDING! who foretold,
V Chinamen would keep their gold;
V Who foresaw our ships would be
V Homeward bound, yet wanting tea;
V Who, to cheer the mourning land,
V Said, “I’ve Howqua still on hand!”
V Who, my Pidding, who but thee?
V Io Pidding! Evoe! THE STATE DOCTOR.
h A BIT OF A FARCE.
h __Dramatis__ __Personæ.__
  RHUBARB PILL (a travelling doctor), by SIR ROBERT PEEL.
  BALAAM (his Man), by COLONEL SIBTHORP.
  COUNTRYMAN, by MR. BULL.
P SCENE. __Tamworth.__
P RHUBARB PILL.—Balaam, blow the trumpet.
# ? a crowd of people.
# ? Ruvsars Pitt.—Balaam, blow the trumpet.
P BALAAM (__blows__).—Too-too-tooit! Silence for the doctor!
P RHUBARB PILL.—Now, friends and neighbours, now’s your time for getting rid
  of all your complaints, whether of the pocket or the person, for I, Rhubarb Pill,
  professor of sophistry and doctorer of laws, have now come amongst you with my
  old and infallible remedies and restoratives, which, although they have not already
  worked wonders, I promise shall do so, and render the constitution sound and
  vigorous, however it may have been injured by poor-law-bill-ious pills, cheap
  bread, and __black__ sugar, prescribed by wooden-headed quacks. (__Aside__.) Balaam,
  blow the trumpet.
P BALAAM (__blows__).—Too-too-tooit! Hurrah for the doctor!
P RHUBARB PILL.—These infallible remedies have been in my possession since
  the years 1835 and 1837, but owing to the opposition of the Cabinet of Physicians,
  I have not been able to use them for the benefit of the public—and myself.
  (__Bows__.) These invaluable remedies—
P COUNTRYMAN.—What be they?
@column
P RHUBARB PILL.—That’s not a fair question—__wait__ __till__ __I’m__ __regularly__ __called__
  __in__footnote:[Sir Robert Peel at Tamworth.]. It’s not that I care about the fee—mine is a liberal profession, and though
  I have a large family, and as many relations as most people, I really think I should
  refuse a guinea if it was offered to me.
P COUNTRYMAN.—Then why doant’ee tell us?
P RHUBARB PILL.—It’s not professional. Besides, it’s quite requisite that I should
  “__feel__ __the__ __patient’s__ __pulse__,” or I might make the dose too powerful, and so—
P COUNTRYMAN.—Get the sack, Mr. Doctor.
P RHUBARB PILL (__aside__).—Blow the trumpet, Balaam.
P BALAAM.—Too-too-tooit—tooit-too-too!
P RHUBARB PILL.—And so do more harm than good. Besides, I should require
  to have the “__necessary__ __consultations__” over the dinner-table. Diet does a great
  deal—not that I care about the “loaves and fishes”—but patients are always more
  tractable after a good dinner. Now there’s an old lady in these parts—
P COUNTRYMAN.—What, my old missus?
P RHUBARB PILL.—The same. She’s in a desperate way.
P COUNTRYMAN.—Ees. Dr. Russell says it’s all owing to your nasty nosdrums.
P RHUBARB PILL.—Doctor Russell’s a—never mind. I say she __is__ very bad, and
  I AM the only man that can cure her.
P COUNTRYMAN—Then out wi’it, doctor—what will?
P RHUBARB PILL.—__Wait__ __till__ __I’m__ __regularly__ __called__ __in.__
P COUNTRYMAN.—But suppose she dies in the meantime?
P RHUBARB PILL.—That’s her fault. I won’t do anything by proxy. I must
  direct my own __administration__, appoint my own nurses for the bed-chamber, have
  my own herbalists and assistants, and see Doctor Russell’s “__purge__” thrown out of
  the window. In short, __I__ __must__ __be__ __regularly__ __called__ __in__. Balaam, blow the trumpet.
# ? [Balaam blows the trumpet, the crowd shout, and the Doctor Lous
# ? gracefully, with one hand on his heart and the other in his breeches
# ? pocket. At the end of the applause he commences singing].
V I am called Doctor Pill, the political quack,
V And a quack of considerable standing and note;
V I’ve clapp’d many a blister on many a back,
V And cramm’d many a bolus down many a throat,
V I have always stuck close, like the rest of my tribe,
V And physick’d my patient as long as he’d pay;
V And I say, when I’m ask’d to advise or prescribe,
V “__You__ __must__ __wait__ __till__ __I’m__ __call’d__ __in__ __a__ __regular__ __way__.”
V Old England has grown rather sickly of late,
V For Russell’s __reduced__ her almost to a shade;
V And I’ve honestly told him, for nights in debate,
V He’s a quack that should never have follow’d the trade.
V And, Lord! how he fumes, and exultingly cries,
V “Were you in my place, Pill, pray what would __you__ say?”
V But I only reply, “If I am to advise,
V __I__ __shall__ __wait__ __till__ __I’m__ __call’d__ __in__ __a__ __regular__ __way__.”
V It’s rather “too bad,” if an ignorant elf,
V Who has caught a rich patient ’twere madness to kill,
V Should have all the credit, and pocket the pelf,
V Whilst you are requested to furnish the skill.
V No! no! __amor__ __patriæ__’s a phrase I admire,
V But I own to an __amor__ that stands in its way;
V And if England should e’er my assistance require,
V __She__ __must__—
@cut cut-53-1
C “WAIT TILL I’M CALL’D IN A REGULAR WAY.”
# ? * Sir Robert Peel at Tamworth.
@rule
h ON DITS OF THE CLUBS.
P Peter Borthwich has expressed his determination—not to accept of the
  speakership of the House of Commons.
P C.M. Westmacott has announced his intention of __not__ joining the new admi-
  nistration; in consequence of which serious defection, he asserts that Sir Robert
  Peel will be unable to form a cabinet.
P “You have heard,” said his Grace of Buckingham, to Lord Abinger, a few
  evenings ago, “how scandalously Peel and his crew have treated me—they have
  actually thrown me overboard. A man of my weight, too!” “That was the
  very objection, my Lord,” replied the rubicund functionary. “Their rotten
  craft could not carry a statesman of your ponderous abilities. Your dead weight
  would have brought them to the bottom in five minutes.”
@page 54 leaf 57
@column
H THE REJECTED ADDRESS OF THE MELANCHOLY WHIGS.
P Alas! that poor old Whiggery should have been so silly as to go a-wooing.
  Infirm and tottering as he is, it was the height of insanity. Down he dropped on
  his bended knees before the object of his love; out he poured his touching addresses,
  lisped in the blandest, most persuasive tones; and what was his answer?
  Scoffs, laughs, kicks, rejection! Even Johnny Russell’s muse availed not, though
  it deserved a better fate. It gained him a wife, but could not win the electors.
  Our readers will discover the genius of the witty author of “Don Carlos” in the
  address, which, though rejected, we in pity immortalise in PUNCH.
V Loved friends—kind electors, once more we are here
V To beg your sweet voices—to tell you our deeds.
V Though our Budget is empty, we’ve got—never fear—
V A long full privy purse, to stand bribing and feeds.
V For, oh! we are out-and-out Whigs—thorough Whigs!
V Then, shout till your throttles, good people, ye crack;
V Hurrah! for the troop of sublime “Thimble-rigs!”
V Hurrah! for the jolly old Downing-street pack.
V What we’ve done, and will do for you, haply you’ll ask:
V All, all, gentle folks, you shall presently see.
V Off your sugar we’ll take just __one__ __penny__ __a__ __cask!__
V Only adding a shilling a pound on your tea.
V That’s the style for your Whigs—your __reforming__ old Whigs!
V Then, shout, &amp;c.
V Off your broad—think of this!—we will take—(if we can)—
V A whole farthing a loaf; then, when wages decline,
V By one-half—as they must—and you’re starving, each man
V In our New Poor Law Bastiles may go lodge, and go dine.
V That’s the plan of your Whigs—your kind-hearted, true Whigs!
V Then, shout, &amp;c.
V Off the fine Memel timber, we’d take—if we could—
V All tax, ’cause ’tis used in the palace and hall;
V On the cottager’s, tradesman’s coarse Canada wood,
V We will clap such a tax as shall pay us for all.
V That’s the “dodge” for your Whigs—your poor-loving, true Whigs!
V Then, shout, &amp;c.
V To free our dear brothers, the niggers, you know
V Twenty millions and more we have fix’d on your backs.
V ’Twas gammon—’twas humbug—’twas swindle! for, lo!
V We __undo__ all we’ve done—we go trade in the blacks.
V Your __humanity__ Whigs!—__anti-slavery__ Whigs!
V Then, shout, &amp;c.
V When to Office we came, full __two__ __millions__ in store
V We found safe and snug. Now, that surplus instead,
V Besides having spent __it__, and __six__ millions more,
V Lo! we’re short, __on__ __the__ __year,__ __only__ __two__ __millions__ __dead__.
V That’s the “__go__” for your Whigs—your __retrenching__ old Whigs
V Then, shout, &amp;c.
V In a word, round the throne we’ve stuck sisters and wives,
V Our brothers and cousins fill bench, church, and steeple;
V Assist us to stick in, at least for __our__ lives,
V And nicely “we’ll sarve out” Queen, Lords, ay, and People.
V That’s the fun for your Whigs—your bed-chamber old Whigs!
V Shout, shout, &amp;c.
P What was the reply to this pathetic, this generous appeal? Name it not at
  Woburn-abbey—whisper it not at Panshanger—breathe it not in the epicurean
  retreat of Brocket-hall! Tears, big tears, roll down our sympathetic checks as
  we write it. It was simply—“Cock-a-doodle-do!”
@rule
h LORD JOHNNY “LICKING THE BIRSE.”
P Lord John Russell, on his arrival with his bride at Selkirk the other day,
  was invested with the burghship of that ancient town. In this ceremony, “licking
  the birse,” that is, dipping a bunch of shoemaker’s bristles in a glass of wine and
  drawing them across the mouth, was performed with all due solemnity by his lord-
  ship. The circumstance has given rise to the following __jeu__ __d’esprit__, which the
  author, Young Ben D’Israeli, has kindly dropped into PUNCH’S mouth:—
V Lord Johnny, that comical dog,
V At trifles in politics whistles;
V In London he went __the__ __whole__ __hog__,
V At Selkirk he’s __going__ __the__ __bristles__.
