  we had intended to favour the public, when the following bill reached us. We feel
  that its contents partake so strongly of what we had heretofore conceived the exclu-
  sive character of PUNCH, that to avoid the charge of plagiarism, as well as to prevent
  any confusion of interests, we have resolved to give insertion to both.
